<title>USA: Asset Guaranty qualifies one issue for insurance.</title>
<headline>Asset Guaranty qualifies one issue for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asset Guaranty Insurance Co. said on Wednesday it qualified one municipal bond issue for secondary insurance on a first-come, first-served basis. --Cookville General Hospital, Tenn., limited capacity.</p>
<p>212-984-9288.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
